// Easy Item Dump
// Original developer: Bud (bud-aj29)
// Successor developers: Jaydee Wetwork & Grok Build
// Desktop container buttons live here. Other container screens only hook them.
// Two stack panels split the icon into hit areas. Each half drives every slot.
// Hotbar stacks are ignored unless $include_hotbar is true.
// Filtered buttons also place the held stack once, into the other inventory.
// An empty slot wins. A partial stack of the same item is the fallback.
// Desktop player deposits try the inventory before the hotbar.
// The place mapping consumes the click so only one destination slot runs.
// container_reset_held clears the left-click latch that place_all would otherwise leave held.
